    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "`saw\"` turns `word` into `\"word \"`\r\nI don't know why I am getting that extra space at the end and would like not to :)\r\nI am just using a black setup for mini.surround.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">saw\"</code> turns <code class=\"notranslate\">word</code> into <code class=\"notranslate\">\"word \"</code><br>\nI don't know why I am getting that extra space at the end and would like not to :)<br>\nI am just using a black setup for mini.surround.</p>",
    "bodyText": "saw\" turns word into \"word \"\nI don't know why I am getting that extra space at the end and would like not to :)\nI am just using a black setup for mini.surround.",
